<title>NETHERLANDS: TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-HEINEKEN TROPHY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>DEN BOSCH 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>First round results on the</p>
<p>second day of the Heineken Trophy combined $500,000 ATP men's</p>
<p>and $175,000 WTA women's grass-court tournament on Tuesday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seed):</p>
<p>Men</p>
<p>Alex Radulescu (Germany) beat Cedric Pioline (France) 6-3 3-6</p>
<p>7-5</p>
<p>Richey Reneberg (U.S.) beat Daniel Vacek (Czech Republic) 5-7</p>
<p>0-1 (Vacek retired injured)</p>
<p>Fernon Wibier (Netherlands) beat Emilio Alvarez (Spain) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>1-Michael Chang (U.S.) beat Fabrice Santoro (France) 4-6 6-4</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Karim Alami (Morocco) beat 2-Thomas Muster (Austria) 6-4 6-2</p>
<p>Women</p>
<p>5-Sabine Appelmans (Belgium) beat Adriana Gersi (Czech</p>
<p>Republic) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>Miriam Oremans (Netherlands) beat 7-Patty Schnyder</p>
<p>(Switzerland) 7-5 6-2</p>
<p>Kristie Boogert (Netherlands) beat Larisa Neiland (Latvia) 4-2</p>
<p>(Neiland retired injured)</p>
<p>Add men's first round:</p>
<p>4-Jonas Bjorkman (Sweden) beat Jan Kroslak (Slovakia) 5-7 7-5 6-1</p>
<p>Hicham Arazi (Morocco) beat Vince Spadea (U.S.) 2-6 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Leander Paes (India) beat Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 6-7 (3-7) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>3-Richard Krajicek (Netherlands) beat Paul Haarhuis (Netherlands) 7-5 7-6 (7-4)</p>
<p>Martin Damm (Czech Republic) beat 5-Marc Rosset (Switzerland) 6-1 7-6 (7-5)</p>
<p>Guillaume Raoux (France) beat Vladimir Voitchkov (Belarus) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Women's first round:</p>
<p>Dominique van Roost (Belgium) beat Linda Wild (U.S.) 7-6 (7-4) 6-2</p>
<p>Sandra Kleinova (Czech Republic) beat Denisa Chladkova (Czech Republic) 7-6 (8-6) 6-4</p>
<p>Barbara Rittner (Germany) beat Aleksandra Olsza (Poland) 6-0 6-3</p>
<p>Florence Labat (Argentina) beat Noelle van Lottum 7-6 (7-4) 7-5</p>
<p>8-Asa Carlsson (Sweden) beat Cristina Torrens-Valero (Spain) 6-3 3-6 7-5</p>
</text>
